   "lines": [
    "Spent the day with",
    "\"Alice\" and \"Rose\"—",
    "dancing, walking,",
    "playing lawn",
    "tennis &c. I have",
    "gotten very well",
    "acquainted with",
    "both of them; Rose",
    "is a very good, pleasant",
    "girl, and as for",
    "pretty Alice Lee,",
    "I think her one",
    "of the sweetest, most",
    "ladylike girls I have",
    "ever met.",
    "They all call me",
    "by my first name",
    "now"
   ],
